  "description": "The clock has finally met its match – meet the TUES 29 Limited 2025 CF, a lightning-fast downhill bike equipped with everything racers need to cheat the stopwatch. With speed at the heart of its design, full-pace 29\" wheels and configurable geometry, it leaves nothing to chance as you chase those split seconds. Leave your hesitations behind – from gaps in the bikepark to smoking World Cups, this is a flat-out race rig ready to take that podium champagne straight to the afterparty.Rocked by privateers across the globe, the latest components from RockShox, Title and TRP are a calculated choice, and learning from our team, we've equipped an O-Chain Active Spider to mute harsh pedal feedback as you charge full-speed-ahead. This is our dream race bike, built to dominate the gravity scene, and now, you can make it yours.",
